OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews spend night fighting
OL,4,Aderelict nightclub blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have spent the night at
OL,7,Fthe scene of a blaze in a derelict
OL,8,Fnightclub in Glasgow city centre.
OL,10,FThe alarm was raised at the former
OL,11,FJumpin' Jaks about 01:36 and
OL,12,FSauchiehall Street is closed between
OL,13,FPitt Street and Douglas Street.
OL,15,FPolice Scotland said there are also
OL,16,Fclosures in place on Renfrew Street at
OL,17,FScott Street and Dalhousie Street and
OL,18,Fadvised the public to avoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
