OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews spend night fighting
OL,4,Aderelict nightclub blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,F(SFRS) said it mobilised nine
OL,8,Fappliances, one height appliance and
OL,9,Fthree specialist resources to the
OL,10,Fscene.
